n 27 executive private terminals around Saudi Arabia with ALTANFEETHI and explore a range of luxurious services from the moment you arrive, until you reach your destination.\n</p>\n<div class=\"container-list-1\">\n<div class=\"plans-list-text-1 txt-top-pad\">\n<p>Enjoy a unique travel experience through ALTANFEETHI:\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-two-columns\">\n    <li>Private terminal</li>\n    <li>Meet &amp; Greet </li>\n    <li>Fast Track through check-in and travel formalities</li>\n    <li>Private transportation from and to the airplane</li>\n    <li>Ensuring baggage collection</li>\n    <li>World-class hospitality</li>\n    <li>Catering</li>\n    <li>A personal assistant</li>\n    <li>Nearby private parking</li>\n    <li>Business center</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"text-position-2\">You can request ALTANFEETHI VIP service through the following sales points:</p>\n<ul class=\"list-one-column\">\n    <li>While booking your flight with Saudia (website and app)</li>\n    <li>On Manage my Booking page (website and app)</li>\n    <li>Saudia sales offices&nbsp;</li>\n    <li>Saudia call center&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plans-list-image-1\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"fasttrack-img\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/altanfeethi/ALTANFEETHI-EN.ashx?rev=cf901e5ddb864a62ae4dc187118613d8&amp;hash=A766E603EED09659840DDB1E2B390AE4\">\n</div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-saudia-general-tablayout class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"booking ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"custom-over