nt with adult.</li>\n    <li>Arriving at ALTANFEETHI Lounges 90 minutes before the flight time, to benefit from the services.</li>\n    <li>Submitting the required and valid documents and information, upon requesting the service, and when located in ALTANFEETHI Lounges, and Update it while required and/or requested.</li>\n    <li>Complying with ALTANFEETHI Lounges terms &amp; conditions and airport regulations related to security and safety whilst being in the lounge.</li>\n    <li>Disclosing any specific needs of the guest when registering the service, e.g., providing a wheelchair, giving information about flight time or flight connection (transit) as per Saudia&nbsp;policies.</li>\n    <li>Photography for the purpose of advertising or marketing, either directly or indirectly is subject to a written and official pre-approval from ALTANFEETHI.</li>\n    <li>Voluntary (Reissue / Rebooking / Reroute / Refund) are not permitted after purchasing the service. </li>\n    <li>For inquiries, contact ALTANFEETHI at: 8001202222. WhatsApp: +966114309330.</li>\n</ul></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}